WEBVTT

01:24.960 --> 01:26.880
ADAPTED FROM
THE LEGEND OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:53.800 --> 01:55.520
Your body is getting worse day by day.

01:57.960 --> 01:59.320
Maybe we should leave early.

02:02.480 --> 02:03.600
You always told me

02:03.680 --> 02:06.240
you didn't want her to see you
at your worst.

02:07.000 --> 02:10.600
You're proud and strong.

02:10.680 --> 02:12.040
Let's leave.

02:15.880 --> 02:17.080
It's time to go.

02:20.560 --> 02:21.520
Is Zhang Jinran back?

02:21.600 --> 02:23.840
We can leave him a message.

02:23.920 --> 02:24.840
We can meet him somewhere else.

02:24.920 --> 02:26.600
How's that thing going?

02:27.160 --> 02:28.120
Have you arranged it?

02:28.200 --> 02:29.880
Yes.

02:31.320 --> 02:32.720
After you leave,

02:33.600 --> 02:36.800
Steward Zhao
will give all your money to her.

02:39.240 --> 02:40.280
Good.

02:42.080 --> 02:43.680
Can you bear to leave her?

02:51.520 --> 02:53.880
Why do you want to make me a belt?

02:53.960 --> 02:56.160
I feel like you're losing weight.

02:56.960 --> 02:57.840
I have lost weight.

02:58.360 --> 03:00.240
I'll make you a new belt.

03:01.880 --> 03:03.600
Don't you want it?

03:05.000 --> 03:06.200
Thank you.

03:07.920 --> 03:09.600
Gaoshou and Yingtao

03:09.680 --> 03:11.960
are going to the west of the city
to work as shopkeepers.

03:12.040 --> 03:13.840
I made them something new.

03:14.360 --> 03:16.560
I'll make one for you, too.
Don't think too much.

03:18.480 --> 03:20.280
I thought I was the only one
who would receive the gift.

03:23.440 --> 03:24.840
Have you figured out what to make

03:25.360 --> 03:27.640
to go to the Jewel Exhibition?

03:33.560 --> 03:35.080
I have an idea.

03:35.800 --> 03:37.640
We smashed one blood-stained pearl.

03:37.720 --> 03:39.560
We can make a pair of beads

03:40.080 --> 03:41.120
out of the colorful glass.

03:41.200 --> 03:42.280
What do you think?

03:44.160 --> 03:46.720
That pair of beads was Kang's tribute.

03:46.800 --> 03:48.120
It's a symbol of friendly relations.

03:48.200 --> 03:51.520
If we make that, we're imitating it.

03:51.600 --> 03:53.640
Even if we win the Jewel Exhibition,

03:53.720 --> 03:55.720
it doesn't make any sense, right?

03:57.160 --> 03:58.360
You have a good point.

04:00.040 --> 04:02.000
How about I add

04:02.080 --> 04:04.440
some of Clear Mind's glass to it?

04:04.520 --> 04:05.680
Will you like it?

04:05.760 --> 04:07.640
Okay. It must be nice.

04:08.920 --> 04:11.960
Walk around Yangzhou with the belt.

04:12.040 --> 04:13.160
Let people know

04:13.240 --> 04:15.440
that Clear Mind
can make belts in addition to jewelry.

04:15.520 --> 04:17.640
Am I your showing stand?

04:17.720 --> 04:20.040
Isn't that okay?

04:20.120 --> 04:22.440
Turn around.
I'll see how much bigger it is.

04:25.520 --> 04:28.120
If you want to make me a belt,
you should also take a ruler.

04:31.600 --> 04:32.520
Wait.

04:34.040 --> 04:35.520
Ruler!

04:37.080 --> 04:39.880
A ruler can measure land and fields.

04:39.960 --> 04:40.920
And it can measure clothes.

04:41.000 --> 04:43.560
The ruler symbolizes justice and order.

04:43.640 --> 04:46.800
Don't you want peace and justice?

04:46.880 --> 04:50.000
We'll make a colorful ruler
out of colorful glass.

04:50.520 --> 04:51.560
What do you think?

04:55.800 --> 04:57.160
It's okay.

04:57.680 --> 04:59.480
Colorful ruler. I know.

04:59.560 --> 05:02.480
I'll ask Mr. Qin and Shiqi to make it.

05:03.520 --> 05:04.920
About the Jewel Exhibition,

05:05.000 --> 05:06.440
you don't have to worry about it.

05:06.520 --> 05:07.920
They should

05:08.000 --> 05:10.360
take charge of Clear Mind alone. Right?

05:11.560 --> 05:12.760
What do you mean?

05:13.320 --> 05:14.360
Are you going to skip
the Jewel Exhibition?

05:15.680 --> 05:18.080
I have a more important thing to do.

05:18.160 --> 05:20.000
What is it?

05:20.080 --> 05:21.200
Spending time with you.

05:21.800 --> 05:23.120
We will go to see the mountains
and rivers.

05:23.640 --> 05:24.800
We agreed.

05:25.360 --> 05:28.560
It's such a big world, we'll go see it.

05:28.640 --> 05:30.520
Now is the best time.

05:34.080 --> 05:35.120
What's wrong?

05:35.880 --> 05:37.040
Don't you want to go with me?

05:40.960 --> 05:42.200
I want to.

05:43.640 --> 05:44.760
But…

05:47.280 --> 05:49.480
I'd prefer you to participate
in the Jewel Exhibition.

05:49.560 --> 05:54.360
I hope that one day,
you will make everyone envy you

05:55.360 --> 05:59.600
and make everyone see your success.

05:59.680 --> 06:01.840
I hope Clear Mind
will have a prosperous business.

06:02.640 --> 06:05.600
I hope your journey is worth it.

06:06.320 --> 06:08.000
I hope you get what you want.

06:22.560 --> 06:24.600
I've gotten what I want.

06:28.400 --> 06:29.760
I hope to spend

06:32.800 --> 06:34.720
the rest of my life

06:36.240 --> 06:37.680
with you in peace.

06:40.600 --> 06:41.800
That would be the best.

07:36.600 --> 07:38.480
Paint here. It's almost done.

07:39.200 --> 07:40.360
-Here?
-Yes.

08:01.240 --> 08:02.360
How about it?

08:04.600 --> 08:05.520
Is it okay?

09:01.680 --> 09:03.880
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

09:04.760 --> 09:07.160
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

09:07.240 --> 09:08.440
Mr. Qin.

09:11.040 --> 09:12.000
How much is it?

09:12.520 --> 09:14.760
I wish you a long life together,

09:14.840 --> 09:16.680
with one heart.

09:16.760 --> 09:18.320
Happy forever.

09:18.840 --> 09:20.480
-Thank you, Mr. Qin.
-Thank you, Mr. Qin.

09:21.640 --> 09:22.760
Take it.

09:22.840 --> 09:23.960
See you.

09:26.280 --> 09:27.120
Let's go, Father.

09:28.960 --> 09:30.120
Look.

09:32.040 --> 09:33.080
It's Gaoshou!

09:37.200 --> 09:39.760
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

09:43.040 --> 09:44.280
Bravo!

09:45.560 --> 09:47.560
-Gaoshou, we'll go there.
-Encore!

09:47.640 --> 09:49.520
-Here you are.
-Encore!

09:49.600 --> 09:50.680
Thank you.

09:51.480 --> 09:52.560
-Go.
-Bravo.

09:52.640 --> 09:54.360
-Come on.
-Bravo.

09:55.960 --> 09:57.640
Wow.

10:00.920 --> 10:01.800
Look.

10:02.320 --> 10:04.720
-Bravo.
-Aren't they…?

10:07.680 --> 10:09.400
Xue Liniang. Yan Fenfen.

10:09.480 --> 10:10.600
Look.

10:10.680 --> 10:13.360
This man is good.

10:13.440 --> 10:18.200
-Thank you. Thank you.
-This girl is good.

10:18.720 --> 10:20.000
You're not good at complimenting.

10:20.080 --> 10:23.040
He's handsome.

10:23.720 --> 10:26.720
She's beautiful. You'll make a cute baby.

10:27.720 --> 10:28.560
-Guys.
-Thank you.

10:28.640 --> 10:30.600
May you have a baby soon.

10:30.680 --> 10:32.560
Thank you.

10:32.640 --> 10:34.400
Let's go dance.

10:34.480 --> 10:36.080
Duanwu. You go. You go.

10:36.160 --> 10:37.240
-I…
-Go.

10:38.720 --> 10:39.560
It's beautiful.

10:39.640 --> 10:41.680
They're good dancers.

10:50.760 --> 10:52.320
Master, go.

10:53.080 --> 10:54.720
I can't dance.

13:47.560 --> 13:48.840
Coming.

13:49.520 --> 13:51.640
Ms. Su. Mr. Yan. I'm coming.

13:51.720 --> 13:52.840
-Mr. Yan.
-Zhang Jinran.

13:52.920 --> 13:53.760
Here comes the imperial edict.

14:04.000 --> 14:06.600
"The Yan family

14:06.680 --> 14:09.320
has been in business for generations
and is loyal.

14:09.840 --> 14:11.240
They escorted Kang to present the tribute.

14:11.760 --> 14:13.080
But they were set up.

14:13.160 --> 14:16.560
It's a pity that they died.

14:16.640 --> 14:18.040
Now, the culprit was caught.

14:18.560 --> 14:21.760
Today, I'll clear their names,
give back their properties,

14:21.840 --> 14:26.000
and reward them with a funeral ceremony
and a hundred bolts of cloth."

14:34.640 --> 14:35.720
Master Yan.

14:36.920 --> 14:38.040
Take the imperial edict.

14:41.280 --> 14:42.360
Thank you, Your Majesty.

14:55.640 --> 14:57.000
It's 20 years late,

14:58.120 --> 14:59.320
but the day has come.

15:01.200 --> 15:02.200
Get up.

15:23.440 --> 15:24.320
Thank you.

15:26.120 --> 15:27.640
We just met by chance,

15:28.240 --> 15:29.360
but it's like we've been friends
for years.

15:31.080 --> 15:34.560
For the sake of this case,
you went through a lot.

15:35.680 --> 15:39.080
You cleared the Yan family's name.

15:39.960 --> 15:41.160
Thank you.

15:41.240 --> 15:42.840
Some people never understand each other.

15:43.600 --> 15:45.160
Some people become friends at first sight.

15:46.280 --> 15:47.360
Not to mention,

15:49.280 --> 15:50.320
you are already my friend.

16:01.360 --> 16:03.920
Master Yan. Can I have a word?

16:06.000 --> 16:06.840
Okay.

16:22.400 --> 16:23.640
Great, Ms. Su.

16:25.000 --> 16:26.360
Great.

16:28.600 --> 16:29.600
Supervisor Kang.

16:29.680 --> 16:31.600
Congratulations.

16:49.280 --> 16:51.280
Mr. Zhang. What is it?

16:57.960 --> 16:59.400
The culprit was caught.

17:00.600 --> 17:01.840
The Yan family's name is cleared.

17:03.920 --> 17:05.280
It's all over.

17:06.599 --> 17:07.440
Congratulations, Mr. Yan.

17:26.079 --> 17:27.240
What's wrong?

17:29.680 --> 17:30.880
We've been through so much together.

17:31.400 --> 17:33.160
I have long regarded you as a friend.

17:33.240 --> 17:34.800
You can be straight.

17:41.000 --> 17:43.200
What's wrong?

17:46.640 --> 17:48.160
Yuchi Wuyi is dead.

17:52.040 --> 17:53.720
I didn't find your antidote.

18:08.880 --> 18:10.080
That's it?

18:12.320 --> 18:13.360
It's okay.

18:14.760 --> 18:17.800
I figured it out a long time ago.

18:20.760 --> 18:23.280
Anyway, thank you for your effort.

18:27.080 --> 18:28.440
By the way,

18:29.520 --> 18:30.640
I have a favor to ask you.

18:32.120 --> 18:33.440
Mr. Yan, just say it.

18:35.280 --> 18:36.320
When I…

18:39.080 --> 18:40.040
No.

18:40.560 --> 18:44.920
Please take care
of Clear Mind in the future.

18:49.240 --> 18:50.400
Actually…

18:57.600 --> 18:58.440
Come on.

19:05.680 --> 19:07.360
Actually, she already knew about it.

19:13.880 --> 19:15.400
She asked me

19:17.480 --> 19:18.800
for everything I did.

19:20.920 --> 19:22.960
She did everything she could
to find famous physicians,

19:23.680 --> 19:25.440
but she didn't find a way to cure you.

19:26.040 --> 19:27.120
She begged me

19:27.640 --> 19:28.920
to go to the imperial physicians.

19:29.560 --> 19:32.120
The imperial physicians studied the poison
of the Black Dragon Pool,

19:32.200 --> 19:34.000
but they didn't find a way to cure it.

19:34.520 --> 19:36.880
Getting Yuchi Wuyi
to reveal the formula for the cure

19:38.560 --> 19:40.440
was her last hope.

19:55.000 --> 19:56.040
People say,

19:56.640 --> 19:58.040
"Those who seek immortality cannot get it

19:58.560 --> 20:00.000
because life actually is short."

20:01.120 --> 20:03.760
Many people are seeking immortality.

20:05.280 --> 20:06.400
But I think

20:07.240 --> 20:08.920
it's best
if you make the most of the moment.

20:09.000 --> 20:10.000
Duanwu.

20:10.880 --> 20:12.280
I hope

20:12.880 --> 20:14.600
that whatever you do

20:15.120 --> 20:16.640
in the future,

20:17.760 --> 20:21.960
you will never be stumped
by anything or anyone.

21:15.880 --> 21:18.360
Painting brings us good luck.

21:18.960 --> 21:22.160
You hung the painting well this year.

21:22.240 --> 21:24.120
You will also hang
the next year's painting.

21:24.200 --> 21:26.440
I have a more important thing to do.

21:27.000 --> 21:28.920
What is it?

21:29.000 --> 21:30.040
Spending time with you.

21:30.760 --> 21:32.240
We will go to see the mountains
and rivers.

21:33.720 --> 21:35.160
We agreed.

21:36.120 --> 21:39.160
It's such a big world, we'll go see it.

22:08.840 --> 22:13.160
JEWELRY DRAWING

22:24.000 --> 22:25.240
You've been praising me a lot lately.

22:26.600 --> 22:28.600
Do you want to be whipped?
Am I wrong to praise you?

22:29.720 --> 22:30.560
No.

22:31.640 --> 22:33.480
It freaks me out when you praise me.

22:34.800 --> 22:37.560
Am I that scary?

23:37.000 --> 23:38.080
You woke up early.

23:40.520 --> 23:41.520
Here's the porridge I made for you.

23:42.960 --> 23:43.800
Come on.

23:48.120 --> 23:49.600
So, there you are.

23:51.120 --> 23:52.440
I couldn't sleep.

23:53.040 --> 23:54.040
I wanted to make you breakfast.

23:55.520 --> 23:57.800
It's Longevity Porridge again.

23:58.600 --> 23:59.440
Have a taste.

24:01.000 --> 24:03.040
Why do you always cook Longevity Porridge?

24:03.120 --> 24:05.600
You said it wasn't good last time.

24:06.120 --> 24:08.560
I stuck to the recipe this time.

24:15.640 --> 24:17.240
What do you think of it?

24:18.720 --> 24:19.920
Just taste it, and you'll see.

24:28.160 --> 24:30.320
Am I making it better?

24:30.400 --> 24:31.280
It tastes better than last time.

24:33.120 --> 24:35.000
Good. Eat more.

24:44.480 --> 24:47.040
The Jewel Exhibition is in a few days.

24:47.120 --> 24:48.840
I'm sure you'll shine

24:49.720 --> 24:50.960
when the time comes.

24:51.040 --> 24:54.680
Our Clear Mind
will be famous all over the world.

24:58.280 --> 24:59.720
I've been thinking a lot lately

25:00.440 --> 25:01.920
about how you've gone

25:02.720 --> 25:06.560
from an arrogant little girl

25:07.080 --> 25:09.000
to the owner of Clear Mind.

25:09.080 --> 25:12.200
It's unbelievable.

25:22.680 --> 25:24.000
Promise me

25:25.400 --> 25:29.280
you will do whatever you want

25:30.600 --> 25:31.760
and never be stumped

25:32.800 --> 25:33.920
by anything or anyone.

25:34.800 --> 25:35.680
Okay?

25:44.480 --> 25:45.360
What are you talking about?

25:46.040 --> 25:47.440
I'm almost done.

25:54.920 --> 25:55.960
Eat more.

26:02.280 --> 26:03.200
Don't leave.

26:18.320 --> 26:19.480
What?

26:30.080 --> 26:31.400
Don't leave, okay?

26:53.400 --> 26:54.680
Can you not leave?

27:06.760 --> 27:07.760
Zijing.

27:18.560 --> 27:20.240
Don't leave.

28:04.040 --> 28:05.240
I was alone.

28:06.400 --> 28:07.520
I was not afraid of death.

28:09.080 --> 28:13.160
Now, I have you.

28:30.600 --> 28:32.640
I'm afraid I'll never see you again.

28:33.880 --> 28:35.200
But I know…

28:38.000 --> 28:39.520
you won't leave me.

29:13.480 --> 29:15.280
If we weren't like this,

29:15.920 --> 29:17.560
would it have ended differently?

29:19.040 --> 29:20.280
Would we…

29:22.920 --> 29:24.440
have been different?

29:33.680 --> 29:35.480
At the Jewel Exhibition,

29:35.560 --> 29:38.120
the shops have been showing off
their treasures for three days.

29:38.640 --> 29:41.520
People from all over the world
came to Yangzhou to watch it.

29:42.880 --> 29:45.000
We invite hundreds of merchants

29:45.080 --> 29:46.760
from all over the world

29:46.840 --> 29:48.400
to vote for the best treasure.

29:48.480 --> 29:49.800
The best treasure

29:49.880 --> 29:50.840
will be given to the states

29:51.680 --> 29:53.560
as a gift from Tang.

29:54.680 --> 29:56.360
We'll count the votes now.

29:59.560 --> 30:01.520
One vote
for Zhenlang Pavilion's Peace Crown.

30:04.600 --> 30:06.080
Zhenlang Pavilion's Peace Crown

30:06.160 --> 30:07.840
is made of gold

30:07.920 --> 30:10.200
and set with 112 pearls.

30:10.280 --> 30:11.960
Illuminate Tang.

30:12.040 --> 30:13.800
Prosperity and peace.

30:13.880 --> 30:16.520
One vote for Clear Mind's Peace Ruler.

30:18.120 --> 30:21.520
Clear Mind's Peace Ruler
is made of colorful glass.

30:21.600 --> 30:23.120
Ten beautiful views of Tang

30:23.200 --> 30:24.960
were carved on the ruler.

30:25.600 --> 30:28.560
Measure the world. Fair and just.

30:34.120 --> 30:37.080
One vote for Shule Merchant
Bosha's Phoenix Jade Pendant.

30:39.640 --> 30:41.280
Shule merchant Bosha

30:41.360 --> 30:43.320
presented the Phoenix Jade Pendant

30:44.000 --> 30:45.880
to praise the Emperor's wisdom.

30:46.480 --> 30:49.600
The world is at peace.
All nations come to worship.

30:50.400 --> 30:52.200
One vote for Clear Mind's Peace Ruler.

30:53.640 --> 30:55.880
One vote for Clear Mind's Peace Ruler.

30:56.400 --> 30:57.920
One vote for Kang's Crystal Wine Utensils.

30:58.720 --> 31:01.160
One vote
for Chang'an Ruifu House's Peace Mirror.

31:01.240 --> 31:03.480
One vote
for Zhenlang Pavilion's Peace Crown.

31:04.080 --> 31:06.240
One vote for Clear Mind's Peace Ruler.

31:06.320 --> 31:08.800
One vote for Kang's Crystal Wine Utensils.

31:09.560 --> 31:12.280
One vote
for Chang'an Ruifu House's Peace Mirror.

31:12.800 --> 31:16.120
One vote for Shule Merchant
Bosha's Phoenix Jade Pendant.

31:17.880 --> 31:19.800
One vote for Clear Mind's Peace Ruler.

31:20.720 --> 31:22.000
All votes have been counted.

31:22.080 --> 31:24.120
Inspector Zhang,
please declare the winner.

31:34.480 --> 31:36.040
Kang's Crystal Wine Utensils

31:36.120 --> 31:40.320
won third place with 72 votes.

31:41.720 --> 31:43.120
-Great!
-Great!

31:43.200 --> 31:44.160
Thank you.

31:50.760 --> 31:52.320
Chang'an Ruifu House's

31:52.840 --> 31:55.680
Peace Mirror won second place

31:56.200 --> 31:58.240
with 97 votes.

31:58.320 --> 32:02.240
-Great!
-Great!

32:02.320 --> 32:03.640
-Great!
-Yeah.

32:08.240 --> 32:10.520
The first place
at the Jewel Exhibition goes to…

32:16.680 --> 32:19.640
Clear Mind's Peace Ruler.

32:19.720 --> 32:23.120
-Great!
-Great!

32:32.720 --> 32:35.800
Ms. Yue, please go to the stage.

32:53.680 --> 32:54.640
Ms. Yue.

32:56.200 --> 32:58.000
Clear Mind won first place.

32:58.960 --> 33:00.320
Is there anything
you'd like to tell everyone?

33:09.560 --> 33:11.240
Clear Mind's Peace Ruler

33:11.760 --> 33:15.360
depicts the scenery in colors.
Its measurement represents justice.

33:16.720 --> 33:19.160
Its colorful glass is rare.

33:19.240 --> 33:22.440
The ten beautiful views of Tang
are beautiful.

33:22.520 --> 33:23.920
And it represents

33:25.240 --> 33:26.760
the fairness and justice

33:27.560 --> 33:28.720
that everyone wants.

33:32.920 --> 33:33.960
This is Clear Mind's best wish

33:40.640 --> 33:42.760
to Tang.

33:44.320 --> 33:46.160
-Great.
-Great.

34:06.200 --> 34:09.159
Ms. Su started from scratch

34:09.760 --> 34:11.199
and won first place at the event.

34:11.280 --> 34:12.760
She's an example to all.

34:13.360 --> 34:16.320
She led the crowd to dismiss Zheng Shiyuan

34:16.400 --> 34:18.560
and gave
the Yangzhou Jewelry Guild integrity.

34:19.159 --> 34:22.560
Later, she assisted in arresting Li Kui

34:22.639 --> 34:24.920
and made the trade routes open as before.

34:25.440 --> 34:26.880
She's doing great.

34:31.280 --> 34:33.120
I recommend Su Muzhe

34:33.199 --> 34:34.639
to be the head
of the Yangzhou Jewelry Guild.

34:35.560 --> 34:37.600
-I agree.
-I agree.

34:37.679 --> 34:39.000
-Me too.
-Me too.

34:39.560 --> 34:41.320
-I agree.
-I agree.

34:41.400 --> 34:42.239
I agree!

34:42.320 --> 34:44.199
-I agree!
-I agree!

34:44.280 --> 34:45.719
-I agree!
-I agree!

34:45.800 --> 34:46.800
-I agree!
-I agree!

34:46.880 --> 34:47.960
-I agree!
-I agree!

34:48.040 --> 34:49.360
-I agree!
-I agree!

34:49.440 --> 34:52.199
-I agree!
-I agree!

35:00.000 --> 35:00.880
Congratulations.

35:07.040 --> 35:08.080
I didn't expect us

35:08.760 --> 35:10.040
to have this unexpected joy

35:10.560 --> 35:12.000
at the Jewel Exhibition.

35:13.800 --> 35:15.400
Ms. Cui recommended Ms. Su
to be the guild lead.

35:16.440 --> 35:18.960
And all directors of the guild agreed.

35:19.040 --> 35:20.960
I was ordered
to hold the Jewel Exhibition.

35:21.560 --> 35:22.600
Now,

35:23.400 --> 35:26.480
I appointed Su Muzhe

35:27.200 --> 35:28.160
as the head of the Yangzhou Jewelry Guild.

35:29.240 --> 35:30.640
-Great.
-Great.

35:30.720 --> 35:32.800
Duanwu, can we open a shop?

35:32.880 --> 35:37.000
We'll open a big shop.

35:37.080 --> 35:39.280
It will be much bigger
than this lower deck.

36:18.920 --> 36:19.840
Great!

36:20.360 --> 36:22.640
-Great!
-Great!

36:22.720 --> 36:23.800
Great!

38:11.120 --> 38:13.560
We carved the mountains and rivers

38:15.320 --> 38:16.760
we walked together

38:18.480 --> 38:20.000
and the four seasons of the world

38:22.160 --> 38:24.920
on the Peace Ruler.

38:30.880 --> 38:31.960
Mountains and rivers

38:33.760 --> 38:35.600
can last forever,

38:36.520 --> 38:37.760
but man cannot live forever.

38:42.200 --> 38:43.680
It's just an exclamation of regret.

38:45.440 --> 38:46.760
Today,

38:47.880 --> 38:49.480
I thank you all for your love.

38:50.640 --> 38:53.520
Clear Mind is honored to win first place.

38:54.480 --> 38:55.880
We went through a lot

38:56.480 --> 38:59.720
to get to this beautiful sight.

39:00.640 --> 39:02.560
I couldn't be more grateful.

39:04.840 --> 39:07.480
Yangzhou Jewelry Guild has a long history.

39:08.280 --> 39:10.120
There's a lot of talent
in every generation.

39:11.920 --> 39:13.120
Today,

39:16.560 --> 39:18.520
I'd like to entrust
the position of guild lead

39:18.600 --> 39:20.320
to Cui Zhuohua,

39:21.360 --> 39:22.600
the owner of Zhenlang Pavilion.

39:30.040 --> 39:31.760
Business is complex.

39:33.600 --> 39:35.480
I want to have a clear mind.

39:35.560 --> 39:36.880
Advance bravely.

39:39.080 --> 39:40.680
Like a boat on the water.

39:41.640 --> 39:44.240
When you go against the current,
face the wind and keep moving.

39:44.960 --> 39:46.200
When you go downstream,

39:49.560 --> 39:50.760
take advantage of the situation.

39:53.440 --> 39:54.320
I believe in you.

39:59.800 --> 40:00.960
You can do better than me.

40:14.400 --> 40:16.160
I want business to be fair.

40:20.840 --> 40:22.600
I want to have a clear mind.

40:25.880 --> 40:27.400
I wish the Yangzhou Jewelry Guild

40:30.920 --> 40:32.600
prosperity

40:35.640 --> 40:37.080
and splendor.

40:54.080 --> 40:55.960
Over the past 40 years,

40:56.720 --> 40:58.640
I have done business in various places,

40:59.720 --> 41:01.800
seen countless mountains and rivers,

41:02.320 --> 41:04.800
and seen the bustling world.

41:05.680 --> 41:06.640
I have regrets,

41:07.200 --> 41:09.400
but I don't regret them.

41:10.120 --> 41:12.000
I hope that self-reliant people

41:12.640 --> 41:14.480
will change from stone to jade

41:15.320 --> 41:17.760
and from sand to pearls.
